        -- self-managed Microsoft AD directory. You cannot make a self-managed Microsoft AD update request if there is an existing self-managed Microsoft AD update request in progress.
        SelfManagedActiveDirectoryConfiguration: SelfManagedActiveDirectoryConfigurationUpdates
        -- The configuration that Amazon FSx for Windows File Server uses to audit and log
        -- user accesses of files, folders, and file shares on the Amazon FSx for Windows File Server
        -- file system..
